  "verseCount": 31,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "12",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2SA 12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nathan Rebukes David",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2SA.12.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2SA.12.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sent Nathan to David. When he came to him, he said, \"There were two men in a certain town, one rich and the other poor.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The rich man had a very large number of sheep and cattle,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but the poor man had nothing except one little ewe lamb he had bought. He raised it, and it grew up with him and his children. It shared his food, drank from his cup and even slept in his arms. It was like a daughter to him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Now a traveler came to the rich man, but the rich man refrained from taking one of his own sheep or cattle to prepare a meal for the traveler who had come to him. Instead, he took the ewe lamb that belonged to the poor man and prepared it for the one who had come to him.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "David burned with anger against the man and said to Nathan, \"As surely as the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2SA.12.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2SA.12.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lives, the man who did this must die!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He must pay for that lamb four times over, because he did such a thing and had no pity.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Nathan said to David, \"You are the man! This is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2SA.12.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2SA.12.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of Israel, says: 'I anointed you king over Israel, and I delivered you from the hand of Saul.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I gave your master's house to you, and your master's wives into your arms. I gave you all Israel and Judah. And if all this had been too little, I would have given you even more.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Why did you despise the word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2SA.12.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2SA.12.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "by doing what is evil in his eyes? You struck down Uriah the Hittite with the sword and took his wife to be your own. You killed him with the sword of the Ammonites.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now, therefore, the sword will never depart from your house, because you despised me and took the wife of Uriah the Hittite to be your own.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"This is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2SA.12.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2SA.12.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "says: 'Out of your own household I am going to bring calamity on you. Before your very eyes I will take your wives and give them to one who is close to you, and he will sleep with your wives in broad daylight.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You did it in secret, but I will do this thing in broad daylight before all Israel.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then David said to Nathan, \"I have sinned against the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2SA.12.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2SA.12.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "2SA 12:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nathan replied, \"The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2SA.12.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2SA.12.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "has taken away your sin. You are not going to die.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But because by doing this you have shown utter contempt for",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2SA.12.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2SA.12.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", the son born to you will die.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After Nathan had gone home, the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2SA.12.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2SA.12.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "struck the child that Uriah's wife had borne to David, and he became ill.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "David pleaded with God for the child. He fasted and spent the nights lying in sackcloth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "on the ground.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The elders of his household stood beside him to get him up from the ground, but he refused, and he would not eat any food with them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On the seventh day the child died. David's attendants were afraid to tell him that the child was dead, for they thought, \"While the child was still living, he wouldn't listen to us when we spoke to him. How can we now tell him the child is dead? He may do something desperate.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "David noticed that his attendants were whispering among themselves, and he realized the child was dead. \"Is the child dead?\" he asked.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "2SA 12:19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Yes,\" they replied, \"he is dead.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then David got up from the ground. After he had washed, put on lotions and changed his clothes, he went into the house of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2SA.12.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2SA.12.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and worshiped. Then he went to his own house, and at his request they served him food, and he ate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "His attendants asked him, \"Why are you acting this way? While the child was alive, you fasted and wept, but now that the child is dead, you get up and eat!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He answered, \"While the child was still alive, I fasted and wept. I thought, 'Who knows? The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2SA.12.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2SA.12.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "may be gracious to me and let the child live.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But now that he is dead, why should I go on fasting? Can I bring him back again? I will go to him, but he will not return to me.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then David comforted his wife Bathsheba, and he went to her and made love to her. She gave birth to a son, and they named him Solomon. The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2SA.12.24",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2SA.12.24"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "loved him;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and because the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2SA.12.25",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2SA.12.25"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "loved him, he sent word through Nathan the prophet to name him Jedidiah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meanwhile Joab fought against Rabbah of the Ammonites and captured the royal citadel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joab then sent messengers to David, saying, \"I have fought against Rabbah and taken its water supply.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now muster the rest of the troops and besiege the city and capture it. Otherwise I will take the city, and it will be named after me.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So David mustered the entire army and went to Rabbah, and attacked and captured it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "David took the crown from their king's",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "head, and it was placed on his own head. It weighed a talent",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "of gold, and it was set with precious stones. David took a great quantity of plunder from the city",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and brought out the people who were there, consigning them to labor with saws and with iron picks and axes, and he made them work at brickmaking.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "David did this to all the Ammonite towns. Then he and his entire army returned to Jerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
